03:11.618 --> 03:14.368
I bust my ass rewriting the story outlines...

03:14.368 --> 03:16.368
just so you can shoot them down
with your self-centered reasoning!

03:16.827 --> 03:20.410
I'll kill you! I'll kill you, you little four-eyed jerk!

03:20.410 --> 03:22.077
That's right.

03:22.993 --> 03:24.243
Yagami?!

03:24.243 --> 03:26.743
You're the show's creator, aren't you?

03:27.952 --> 03:29.118
How do you know?

03:29.118 --> 03:31.702
In the cosplay world, you're practically a god.

03:32.868 --> 03:35.993
And for a god, I'll forgive just about anything.

03:35.993 --> 03:36.868
Release.

03:39.452 --> 03:41.785
There, you see?

03:41.785 --> 03:44.743
Miko-Rayer beats all the enemies,

03:44.743 --> 03:46.868
and then she and the creator Ooizumi are...

03:46.868 --> 03:47.952
...joined together.

03:47.952 --> 03:49.535
No!

03:50.827 --> 03:52.368
Katsuragi! You, too?!

03:52.368 --> 03:54.827
Don't be deceived by this illusion!

03:54.827 --> 03:56.077
Release.

04:00.118 --> 04:02.368
You know the certainty
of this feeling means it's true.

04:02.952 --> 04:05.993
Sister-Rayer envelops the world
in purifying light,

04:05.993 --> 04:08.035
and to Ooizumi, the show's creator...

04:08.035 --> 04:10.618
...she gives her body and heart in holy service.

04:10.618 --> 04:12.160
Don't!

04:17.160 --> 04:19.493
You belong to me alone, Big Brother!

04:19.993 --> 04:21.160
B-Big Brother?!

04:21.952 --> 04:24.702
The only one who can give her virginal purity...

04:24.702 --> 04:28.410
to Ooizumi, the creator,
and save the world is Dian-Rayer.

04:28.827 --> 04:30.452
Virginal purity...?

04:30.785 --> 04:33.368
No! Ooizumi is mine!

04:33.577 --> 04:35.035
No, he's mine!

04:35.285 --> 04:37.202
Go on and choose, Ooizumi!

04:37.202 --> 04:39.077
I want to accept your love!

04:39.077 --> 04:40.452
I want you to take my bloomers off!

04:42.743 --> 04:44.160
Enough...

04:44.160 --> 04:46.243
Do what you want with me!

04:47.743 --> 04:49.327
A dream?

04:49.660 --> 04:52.077
...Joined to Ooizumi in holy service...

04:49.661 --> 04:52.077
...give Big Brother her virginal purity...

04:49.662 --> 04:52.077
...take bloomers off to join in holy service...

04:49.663 --> 04:52.077
...bloomers bloomers bloomers take them off...

04:49.664 --> 04:52.077
