04:49.666 --> 04:52.077
...she wants me to take her bloomers off~~

04:53.618 --> 04:55.493
WHAT AM I WRITING?!

04:59.660 --> 05:02.660
Is this what they call frustration?

05:03.285 --> 05:06.035
We've both been so busy
since that thing in the hotel...

05:06.035 --> 05:08.577
that Yagami and I haven't had
a moment alone with each other.

05:13.868 --> 05:16.410
We finished a lot earlier than usual, huh?

05:16.410 --> 05:20.493
I just had a bit part today,
but thanks to you, I had to wait two hours.

05:21.077 --> 05:24.035
Why don't you come shopping with me
to take your mind off it?

05:24.660 --> 05:26.785
Sorry, I have a previous engagement.

05:28.368 --> 05:30.743
Oh... I see.

05:31.368 --> 05:34.327
I heard Nobunaga's going to be
a regular from now on.

05:34.327 --> 05:37.785
Yeah, one of the four bad guys
plotting to overthrow their masters.

05:38.410 --> 05:40.868
You try moving in on him and
our friendship's done, got it?!

05:42.827 --> 05:44.243
Oh, Natsumi!

05:44.243 --> 05:45.618
Good job today.

05:45.618 --> 05:47.327
And you, too.

05:47.327 --> 05:50.452
Although... I can see with one look.

05:51.743 --> 05:54.160
You're trying real hard
to get someone to notice you.

05:55.868 --> 05:58.368
There's someone you'd
like to show that to, isn't there?

06:01.785 --> 06:05.118
Still, proportion is the basis of fashion.

06:05.118 --> 06:08.285
You'll have more luck with something
that makes you look naturally cute

06:08.285 --> 06:09.910
than trying to force out beauty.

06:09.910 --> 06:11.827
Just... Mind your own business!

06:14.368 --> 06:15.952
Someone she'd like to show it to?

06:15.952 --> 06:17.618
A confession?!

06:19.202 --> 06:23.202
S-sorry, but you mean it?

06:23.202 --> 06:26.993
I want to talk to him about Biker and other stuff,

06:26.993 --> 06:30.868
but I get so embarrassed that
I can't face him, so I may as well...

06:30.868 --> 06:32.535
B-but...

06:32.535 --> 06:34.368
Hikaru, do you know?

06:34.827 --> 06:37.035
When a girl finds a boy she likes,

06:37.035 --> 06:40.952
female hormones make
her body react on its own.

06:41.452 --> 06:45.368
Your breasts and butt get bigger,
to attract his attention.

06:45.952 --> 06:47.285
Seriously?

06:47.285 --> 06:49.993
Anyway, there's someone I like now!

06:49.993 --> 06:51.952
I have to act!

06:54.993 --> 06:56.993
This... This isn't good.

06:57.827 --> 07:00.618
At this rate, I'll be the only one who...!

07:01.493 --> 07:02.493
All right, then!

07:09.368 --> 07:12.327
They're all stepping up their game, aren't they?

07:16.410 --> 07:20.327
If I just put some effort into this,
I'll have him in no time!

07:25.827 --> 07:28.743
Yagami... I just need to see you!

07:30.327 --> 07:33.285
Just a look at her face,
then I'll head straight back...

07:33.285 --> 07:35.493
and keep working on my outline.

07:38.160 --> 07:41.118
I have to make sure
I don't run into Ikita.

07:44.118 --> 07:46.452
She's on stand by in the waiting room, huh?

07:47.035 --> 07:48.327
Ooizumi?

07:49.285 --> 07:51.368
Yagami!

07:53.160 --> 07:54.493
You, again.

07:54.493 --> 07:57.327
Typical reaction, as usual, Kid.

07:57.327 --> 07:59.868
How many times do I have to
tell you not to tease your elders?!

08:00.452 --> 08:03.702
You sure you wanna do that?

08:00.453 --> 08:05.535
All I have to do is loosen my lips...
and you'll be in big trouble!

08:09.577 --> 08:14.577
Now that we know where we stand,
you can come shop with me today.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.993
You can carry my bags for me.

08:18.243 --> 08:22.493
And in return, I'll do a Rayerge
with your favorite panties.

08:22.493 --> 08:23.410
Huh?

08:23.535 --> 08:27.952
I said, I'll let you pick them out. My panties...

08:29.702 --> 08:32.368
You can choose them yourself, can't you?!

08:32.368 --> 08:34.618
I think you're involved in that decision, too.

08:35.160 --> 08:39.577
I put them on, but you're the one
who takes them off, right?

08:39.910 --> 08:42.452
Take that! The no-bra attack!

08:45.702 --> 08:47.618
Wh-what?

08:47.618 --> 08:50.368
Relax, that's one thing I'll never do.

08:50.910 --> 08:55.077
Compared to Yagami and Katsuragi,
there's no contest.

08:57.077 --> 09:02.452
You need to do some growing up before
you can work THAT angle, little girl.

09:03.285 --> 09:05.868
If you're done, I have to get going.

09:08.743 --> 09:10.535
No way...

09:10.952 --> 09:12.702
What was that?

09:12.702 --> 09:15.410
What was that? What was that?!
WHAT WAS THAT?!

09:15.410 --> 09:17.368
That jerk...!

09:17.535 --> 09:19.410
NATSUMI YAGAMI
YOUKO KATSURAGI

09:20.202 --> 09:22.702
It might feel weird if Katsuragi is with her,

09:23.410 --> 09:26.327
but I can't hold back this longing

09:23.411 --> 09:26.327
I have to see Yagami!

09:37.827 --> 09:38.618
Not here.

09:39.243 --> 09:41.118
Maybe they're shooting.

09:43.660 --> 09:44.993
Ow...

09:45.868 --> 09:47.952
Who did that just now?!

09:49.035 --> 09:50.785
Jougasaki?!

09:52.285 --> 09:54.285
Wh-what's going on?

10:02.243 --> 10:06.410
I... I can't do it the way the others can.

10:06.910 --> 10:09.493
This is the only way!

10:12.410 --> 10:14.868
You won't get away!

10:25.785 --> 10:27.077
No escape...

10:27.368 --> 10:29.243
Ooizumi...

10:29.243 --> 10:31.702
Look, I'll just say it straight out.

10:32.243 --> 10:35.577
Yagami, will you stop going after Ooizumi?

10:35.910 --> 10:36.910
Wha... Me?!

10:37.368 --> 10:41.035
Oh, so you you're going to
hit on him to get a bigger part...

10:41.035 --> 10:44.827
because you just don't have
the appeal otherwise. How vulgar!

10:45.410 --> 10:48.493
Yagami... I've never seen this side of her.

10:49.827 --> 10:54.660
So, it looks like you also knew
he's the creator of Cos-Prayers.

10:57.285 --> 11:00.243
He was crazy about me from the start.

11:00.493 --> 11:04.035
All I had to do was give him some loving
looks and I had him wrapped around my finger.

11:05.493 --> 11:07.868
Oh, you think that'll work?

11:07.993 --> 11:10.785
I just had to act like I was
worried about my performance...

11:10.785 --> 11:14.243
to get him to try so hard
to give me his useless advice.

11:15.910 --> 11:19.243
A sad perv like him is no match for my charms.

11:21.118 --> 11:23.743
Oh, you think you're so hot.

11:23.743 --> 11:25.952
You, too?

11:26.910 --> 11:30.868
You knew? That I was writing the show?

11:32.410 --> 11:33.660
Well...

11:35.243 --> 11:37.618
You knew, and that's why you're hitting on me?!

11:41.118 --> 11:43.202
So what if I did?!

11:43.660 --> 11:46.452
Yeah, it's true! We all knew you
were writing the show!

11:47.118 --> 11:49.285
Ever since the trip to that southern island!

11:50.535 --> 11:51.910
What?!

11:52.327 --> 11:53.952
Really?

11:53.952 --> 11:57.285
Really. I heard it with my own ears!

11:57.285 --> 11:58.785
Ooizumi is...

11:58.785 --> 12:00.952
...the show's creator?

12:01.660 --> 12:05.993
Yagami and Katsuragi knew,
that's why they were hitting on you!

12:05.993 --> 12:09.243
I grew up the middle child between two brothers,

12:09.243 --> 12:11.452
so I never learned how to use
my being a woman as a weapon!

12:11.452 --> 12:14.910
But I won't let that be the reason
I get a smaller part!

12:17.452 --> 12:21.493
All of you... You'll do anything
to get a part, won't you?!

12:22.827 --> 12:26.202
Oh, Ooizumi, what are you doing back th-

12:27.118 --> 12:30.743
Well, well, as popular as ever, I see.

12:31.327 --> 12:33.743
You want your parts so badly?

12:34.077 --> 12:37.535
I'll give you all that you can stand!

12:53.743 --> 12:59.077
You might notice, as I peep through the viewfinder

12:59.368 --> 13:02.327
That you're the only one

13:02.327 --> 13:06.202
That I was following

13:06.827 --> 13:09.702
Bit by bit, our time together

13:09.702 --> 13:12.868
Starts to overlap

13:13.702 --> 13:16.077
And these feelings I can't hide

13:16.077 --> 13:19.910
Don't have to be hidden anymore

13:20.743 --> 13:24.160
Like the moon and the stars long ago

13:24.160 --> 13:26.785
Once promised

13:27.535 --> 13:31.118
The two of us will always

13:31.118 --> 13:34.785
Be connected

13:34.868 --> 13:38.118
Stronger than anyone, closer than anyone

13:38.118 --> 13:41.577
Yes, I'm here to love you

13:41.827 --> 13:45.160
In my eyes and in my heart

13:45.160 --> 13:48.410
You blaze for me

13:48.535 --> 13:51.868
Even if the winds blow and the rains fall

13:52.077 --> 13:55.327
I'll stay with you, as long as we're together

13:55.452 --> 13:58.952
Yesterday, surely, tomorrow, even moreso

13:58.952 --> 14:02.827
You'll be that much dearer to me

14:08.827 --> 14:23.827
NEXT
EPISODE

14:09.993 --> 14:12.493
I'm sorry.

14:12.868 --> 14:16.702
Help me! NO!

14:17.577 --> 14:20.868
The base suit is a little too revealing.

14:20.868 --> 14:23.702
Can't we use the usual one?
